  "description": "Prepare models and diagnose readiness on an existing Ollama server independently of chat providers. Discover registered and running models, check health/version, explicitly preload or unload compatible models, and download models with streaming progress. What's New in v1.0.0: shared Serving contracts, distinct installation/load states, cancellation-aware HTTP and validated download completion. Uses a caller-owned HttpClient; targets .NET Standard 2.1 without a Mythosia.AI core dependency. No server hosting or chat API.",
