  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 introduces OllamaServer with health/version discovery, registered/running inventory, explicit preload/unload and NDJSON downloads with terminal-success validation. Shared Serving contracts, caller-owned HTTP, request-local authentication, sanitized errors and cancellation are included. Live checks used Ollama 0.34.4 and qwen2.5:0.5b; see full notes for coverage, the initial pull failure and compatibility limits. Cancellation does not guarantee server-side rollback. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/serving/Mythosia.AI.Serving.Ollama/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v100",
